    "teach_6": {
      "id": "teach_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Multi-year joins look large, but full years let us drop a common factor of 12.\n\nIf A invests ₹25k in year 1, ₹35k in years 2 and 3, total weight scale = 25 + 35 + 35 = 95.\nA partner joining in year 2 only counts the last two years.",
